    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Expense Weekly Report (bonus B1)\nMonday 08:00 -> Config Report (period = previous calendar week) -> reads the expenses table -> keeps final decisions (approved/rejected by decidedAt) in the period -> Convert Amounts (text -> number) -> Summarize by department, category, decision, currency -> HTML table + LLM commentary (Basic LLM Chain) -> e-mail to finance.\n\n**Manual test:** Manual Trigger -> Manual Test Window overrides the period with the last 7 days (label starts with TEST). Config Report uses the test values only if they exist, so the Monday schedule keeps the calendar-week logic.\n\nSetup: financeEmail in Config Report (placeholder), OpenRouter and Gmail credentials. The workflow is not published; publish it for the schedule to run.",
